      "created_at": "2018-08-15T22:27:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just received my Collector’s Case in the mail and opened it right up. But there’s an issue. Has anyone else had an issue where the bottom left drawer is stuck and won’t open? All the other drawers open perfectly, but for the life of me I cannot open that last drawer and I dare not pull any harder as I’m already bending the drawer and I’m afraid it will rip.</p>",
