      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/8e8cbc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-08-23T05:30:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had the same with my bottom-right drawer, and trying to run something round the edges had no effect. In the end, I did just pull until it came free; no permanent harm, and it doesn’t stick at all now, but it was worrying, and I can’t necessarily recommend that solution.</p>",
